autonomous record kind=message data={"created_at": "2026-09-17T05:13:45.278543", "id": "a1186161-400a-40b0-ad94-027943027c56", "public": false, "recipients": ["v"], "sender_actor_id": "s", "text": "Tack f\u00f6r ert tydliga besked. Vi bekr\u00e4ftar att vi bokar in det gemensamma S-V-C-MP-m\u00f6tet f\u00f6r att slutf\u00f6ra budgetramen och verifieringsmekanismen. Vi accepterar era fyra krav som grund f\u00f6r paketet: (1) en reell budgetroll med formell vetor\u00e4tt \u00f6ver ramen, inte bara konsultation; (2) tidsatta och m\u00e4tbara \u00e5taganden om v\u00e4lf\u00e4rd, bost\u00e4der, j\u00e4mlikhet och minskad vinstjakt, skrivna in i regeringsunderlaget; (3) en oberoende verifieringsmekanism med regelbundna avst\u00e4mningar; och (4) ett tydligt brott med Tid\u00f6politiken. V\u00e5r linje \u00e4r en ren S-regering d\u00e4r V f\u00e5r avg\u00f6rande, bindande inflytande \u00f6ver budget och sakpolitik utan regeringsplats, i linje med C:s och KD:s r\u00f6da linjer. Vi vill att ni ska kunna peka p\u00e5 reformer som b\u00e4r er signatur. L\u00e5t oss konkretisera detaljerna nu.", "turn": 1, "visibility": "private"}
autonomous record kind=message data={"created_at": "2026-09-17T05:13:45.287924", "id": "1e989128-1049-4449-b3ae-4f66670eba07", "public": false, "recipients": ["c"], "sender_actor_id": "s", "text": "Tack f\u00f6r ert bekr\u00e4ftade st\u00f6d och f\u00f6r att ni accepterar V som budgetst\u00f6dparti utanf\u00f6r regeringen. Vi bokar in det trilaterala S-C-MP-samtalet skyndsamt f\u00f6r att formalisera reform- och budgetramen: konkreta, verifierbara \u00e5taganden kring f\u00f6retagande och decentralisering samt en tydlig gemensam budgetv\u00e4g. Vi bekr\u00e4ftar att V ges en stark, synlig och bindande budgetroll utan regeringsplats f\u00f6r att s\u00e4kra V:s tolerans, samtidigt som ramen garanterar C:s egna reformprioriteringar. Vi ser fram emot att konkretisera paketet tillsammans med er och MP.", "turn": 1, "visibility": "private"}
autonomous record kind=message data={"created_at": "2026-09-17T05:13:45.295949", "id": "376dbb94-e2c0-4961-b974-8c5715af29a2", "public": false, "recipients": ["mp"], "sender_actor_id": "s", "text": "Tack f\u00f6r ert bekr\u00e4ftade st\u00f6d. Vi formaliserar de bindande klimat- och milj\u00f6\u00e5tagandena i det slutliga paketet: Parisanpassat m\u00e5l och utsl\u00e4ppsbana, gr\u00f6n budgetram, samt konkreta \u00e5taganden om natur, transporter och en r\u00e4ttvis omst\u00e4llning, med en verifieringsmekanism. Vi vill fastst\u00e4lla MP:s roll \u2013 vi \u00e4r \u00f6ppna f\u00f6r att diskutera regeringsdeltagande, men en starkt inflytelserik st\u00f6droll med reellt, verifierbart klimatinflytande kan ocks\u00e5 fungera. Vi bekr\u00e4ftar att V ges mycket stort, bindande inflytande \u00f6ver budget och sakpolitik utan formellt regeringsdeltagande, f\u00f6r att h\u00e5lla ihop underlaget. L\u00e5t oss tillsammans med V och C konkretisera reform- och budgetramen i det gemensamma m\u00f6tet.", "turn": 1, "visibility": "private"}
autonomous record kind=message data={"created_at": "2026-09-17T05:13:45.305429", "id": "795a0c7b-74cd-4e54-bd08-e65b7bdcaa4b", "public": false, "recipients": ["l"], "sender_actor_id": "s", "text": "Tack f\u00f6r ert fortsatta f\u00f6rtroende. Vi vill konkretisera det konfidentiella reservsp\u00e5ret. F\u00f6r en st\u00f6d-/toleransroll utanf\u00f6r regeringen \u00e4r vi beredda att \u00e5ta oss tydliga, synliga liberala skolreformer: st\u00e4rkt l\u00e4rarauktoritet, kunskapsfokus samt ordning och studiero, med l\u00e4skunnighet som prioriterat m\u00e5l. Vi \u00e4r ocks\u00e5 \u00f6ppna f\u00f6r liberala reformer inom r\u00e4ttsstat, ansvarsfull finanspolitik och st\u00e4rkt europeiskt samarbete. L:s roll vore st\u00f6d/tolerans utanf\u00f6r regeringen (MP:s r\u00f6da linje mot L i regering respekteras). Budgetv\u00e4gen: en gemensam finanspolitisk ram d\u00e4r L:s st\u00f6d inte f\u00e4ller regeringens f\u00f6rsta budget \u2013 vi bygger p\u00e5 S+V+C+MP=176 f\u00f6r budgetmajoritet, med L som breddande buffert. Vi vill g\u00e4rna diskutera detaljerna konfidentiellt innan n\u00e5got binds.", "turn": 1, "visibility": "private"}
autonomous record kind=argument data={"action": "Convene and chair the joint S-V-C-MP meeting to finalise the binding, verifiable support/budget partnership and the trilateral S-C-MP reform/budget framework, and respond to L's confidential probe with concrete liberal school reform commitments and a credible budget path.", "actor_id": "s", "budget_slot": 1, "challenger_actor_ids": null, "desired_effect": "A concrete, binding, verifiable S-led minority government package is established: S as statsminister, V/C/MP as support/budget parties with V outside government but holding a real budget veto over the ram, time-bound measurable commitments on welfare/housing/equality/reduced profit-seeking, an independent verification mechanism, and a clear break with Tid\u00f6 policy; C gets verifiable enterprise/decentralisation influence and MP gets binding climate commitments; this secures V's tolerance and a credible budget path (S+V+C+MP=176) while keeping SD out of government.", "id": "5f2108c3-5892-4615-8c08-052ceff8efca", "pros": ["S+V+C+MP=176 gives a budget majority and can reject an M candidate, while Tid\u00f6=173 cannot reach the 175-NO threshold to reject an S PM, so the package is mathematically viable.", "V has explicitly accepted the support/budget partnership framework as a basis and asked to book the S-V-C-MP meeting, so finalising the binding verifiable details directly addresses V's pivotal condition against symbolism.", "C and MP have both confirmed support for S's PM and the S-led minority model, and C has proposed the trilateral S-C-MP framework, so the reform/budget ram has a ready negotiating forum.", "Giving V a real, verifiable budget role (veto, time-bound commitments, independent verification) satisfies V's demands without violating C's and KD's red line against V in government, holding the underlay together.", "Responding concretely to L's confidential probe keeps L as a reserve/buffer that can stabilise the package and balance V's demands, without bringing L into government (respecting MP's red line)."], "status": "open_for_cons", "turn": 1}
